	(text "Tach: open collector, 2 pulses/rev, counted with PCNT. Alphacool ES: tach -> GPIO18, NTC -> GPIO4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e616ace-b34a-563e-964b-41e55d9d89e0")
	)
	(text "Fan and pump: LEDC PWM at 25 kHz through one BSS138DW element each, because the PWM input can sit at 5.25 V (Intel 4-wire spec) and GPIOs are not 5 V tolerant. GPIO high = FET on = 0% drive; firmware inverts the duty."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
